          "text": "<p>Consider the following set of processes, with arrival times and CPU burst times given in milliseconds. What is the average turnaround time for these processes using the Preemptive Shortest Remaining Processing Time First (SRPT/SRTF) algorithm?</p><p>\\[<br>\\begin{array}{c|c|c}<br>\\text{Process} & \\text{Arrival Time} & \\text{Burst Time} \\\\<br>\\hline<br>\\text{P1} & 0 & 6 \\\\<br>\\text{P2} & 2 & 2 \\\\<br>\\text{P3} & 3 & 5 \\\\<br>\\text{P4} & 5 & 2<br>\\end{array}<br>\\]</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>$5.5$ ms<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$6.25$ ms<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$6.5$ ms<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$7$ ms</li></ol>",
